'''Nekoluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was introduced in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.0 Update|Version 5.0]] greatly increases his attack power and gives him the ability to [[Freeze|freeze]] any non-[[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], he is unlocked in rolling any available banner.

